abstract: >-
  Future Pruning is a control layer for proactive personal agents. An agent plants
  decision points in its own future; when each arrives, it reopens the current record
  and authority and chooses to do it, change it, or let it go, recording the reason.
  The future event is an occasion to reconsider, not an instruction to act.
